<title>
DTC B1951
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
As each terminal voltage is affected by the battery voltage, check that battery voltage is 12 V or more with ignition “ON”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Before performing, check that related fuses of headlight auto leveling control module power circuit have not blown out.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If any fuse has blown out, replace the fuse and check circuits connected to the blown fuse for short circuit to ground.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A9204010001">
<title>
DTC Detecting Condition and Trouble Area
</title>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "3.602in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "3.602in"/>
<thead>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
DTC detecting condition
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
Trouble area
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
B1951: Ignition Power Supply Voltage Data Malfunction
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Any of the following conditions is met.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Headlight auto leveling control module power supply circuit voltage is higher than 16.4 V for 10 sec.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Headlight auto leveling control module power supply circuit voltage is lower than 9.3 V for 10 sec.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Headlight auto leveling control module power supply circuit and/or ground circuit
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Headlight auto leveling control module
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Charging system
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
